job with all our videos.

00:10:34.886 --> 00:10:38.939
So, Christina, high five
for a job well done.

00:10:38.939 --> 00:10:39.970
- Hey, Lily!

00:10:39.970 --> 00:10:41.146
And thank you, Pavo.

00:10:41.146 --> 00:10:43.718
- So thank you so much for
watching, but more importantly,

00:10:43.718 --> 00:10:45.591
being on this journey with me.

00:10:45.591 --> 00:10:48.186
When I first started
out, I really didn't know

00:10:48.186 --> 00:10:49.929
